# Files vendored from outside this project keep the bytes their authors
# published, on every platform. Without this a Windows checkout with the
# default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites every LF to CRLF, and the file on disk
# is not the file `tests/samples/external/SOURCES.md` says it is.
#
# `-text`, not `binary`: no end-of-line conversion either way, and diffs stay
# readable.
tests/samples/external/** -text
